Any2Odyssey is a Rust reimplementation of Any2Odd 0.7.3 by Zhandragon
(https://github.com/Zhandragon/Any2Odd), the continuous desktop 3D
companion for the Samsung Odyssey 3D G90XF. Any2Odd is licensed under the
GNU General Public License version 3 (GPL-3.0-only); Any2Odyssey keeps that
license. The architecture, the Samsung engine integration, the capture and
overlay design, the user-facing behaviour and the written Help are derived
from Any2Odd. All code in this repository was rewritten in Rust; no code from
Any2Odd is included verbatim.

Any2Odd in turn credits Any2C1 (CubeVi) as the inspiration for its
continuous-conversion workflow and PortalAI (Zhandragon) for its visual
presentation. Any2Odyssey ships none of their code or assets, and the
donation material that Any2Odd carried for its maintainer has been removed;
support the upstream author at https://github.com/sponsors/Zhandragon.

Samsung, Odyssey, Odyssey 3D Hub, LeiaSR and Leia are trademarks of their
respective owners. Any2Odyssey does not include Samsung or Leia binaries, AI
models or calibration data.

